Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.22,0:00:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}亲爱的阿姨
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.06,0:00:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.86,0:00:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.74,0:00:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.25,0:00:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.18,0:00:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}喂
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.01,0:00:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}（叔叔）你又没去耍朋友啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.13,0:00:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.63,0:00:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}没有
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.45,0:00:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}又没得啥子耍头，浪费钱
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}（叔）你阿姨哈尔要来
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.57,0:00:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}哦 是吗?不提前说一声
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.03,0:00:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}（叔）有啥子哎
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.18,0:00:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}屋头乱糟糟的
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.64,0:01:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}你晓得 单身狗
Dialogue: 2,0:01:02.01,0:01:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.00,0:01:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.63,0:01:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}（叔）你麻烦
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.14,0:01:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}还有 阿姨来干啥子嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.00,0:01:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我都是成年人了，要她来照顾
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.14,0:01:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}（叔）她很会照顾人的
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.13,0:01:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}那只有麻烦阿姨了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.00,0:01:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}（叔）你要听话哦
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.63,0:01:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}肯定，她毕竟是我阿姨啊
Dialogue: 2,0:01:15.19,0:01:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}（叔）一切听她“安排”就是
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.01,0:01:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}嗯
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.63,0:01:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}感觉不太好意思样
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.50,0:01:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}（叔）有啥子嘛，亲戚
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.07,0:01:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.67,0:01:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好的 我听话就是
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.50,0:01:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.00,0:01:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.74,0:01:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
