Dialogue: 2,0:01:43.63,0:01:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}真麻烦啊
Dialogue: 2,0:01:46.14,0:01:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:47.86,0:01:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.84,0:01:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}来咯
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.51,0:01:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.00,0:01:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.64,0:01:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.92,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:00.46,0:02:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:01.17,0:02:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“幺弟，好久不见啊”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:03.02,0:02:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}咋这么快就来了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“想早点过来收拾你嘛”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.37,0:02:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“如果一个男孩家没有女人”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:10.47,0:02:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“照顾肯定会乱得不行”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:13.12,0:02:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“让我看看亮娃家到底有好乱”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:15.47,0:02:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:18.06,0:02:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“好啦，我开始啦”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:19.56,0:02:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不行啊
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.11,0:02:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.30,0:02:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.37,0:02:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.97,0:02:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:30.50,0:02:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.14,0:02:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“呕哇 真是太乱了”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.56,0:02:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.21,0:02:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“一个屋头怎么能这么乱啊”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.00,0:02:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.68,0:02:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“这个袋子不用的吧”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.27,0:02:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.89,0:02:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不用了吧，太脏了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:45.03,0:02:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:46.24,0:02:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.07,0:02:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.86,0:02:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“平时都不收拾的吗？”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:49.56,0:02:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}很少
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.53,0:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:53.00,0:02:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.56,0:02:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:55.24,0:02:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:58.00,0:02:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.56,0:03:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.50,0:03:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:03.65,0:03:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.34,0:03:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.06,0:03:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:09.63,0:03:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.50,0:03:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.13,0:03:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.19,0:03:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:13.19,0:03:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.46,0:03:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}今天吃得好饱啊
Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.05,0:03:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}有阿姨照顾真好
Dialogue: 2,0:03:21.57,0:03:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“呵呵，是吗？”
Dialogue: 2,0:03:23.17,0:03:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}D阿姨的手艺真是太好啦
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“啊哈 多谢夸奖啦”
Dialogue: 2,0:03:28.52,0:03:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}这么
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.28,0:03:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}D阿姨在家的时间就像
Dialogue: 2,0:03:31.09,0:03:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}结了婚，娶了你当老婆一样
Dialogue: 2,0:03:33.10,0:03:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“啊 我都是老女人了”
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.49,0:03:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“如果亮娃儿累了就去睡觉吧”
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.53,0:03:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}啊
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.55,0:03:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}那就提前
Dialogue: 2,0:03:40.47,0:03:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}去洗澡睡觉啦
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.04,0:03:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}晚安 漂亮的阿姨
Dialogue: 2,0:03:53.58,0:03:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:55.75,0:03:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.21,0:03:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:59.51,0:04:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“亲爱的幺弟”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.28,0:04:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“阿姨和你一起洗吧”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.72,0:04:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}这怎么行
Dialogue: 2,0:04:04.94,0:04:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}你是女人我是男人
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.89,0:04:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“我还以为你是年轻人”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:11.97,0:04:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“性观念比较开放”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:15.14,0:04:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只是 突然 不习惯
Dialogue: 2,0:04:19.30,0:04:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“没有和女人一起洗过澡？”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.67,0:04:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}啊 当然
Dialogue: 2,0:04:24.63,0:04:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}连亲嘴都没有过
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.05,0:04:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“嗯 那和阿姨怎么样？”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.21,0:04:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“让阿姨教你成为男人”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:33.76,0:04:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}哎 这个 想起还多好耍
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.99,0:04:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“想过和阿姨做爱吗？”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“真正的性交”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.70,0:04:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}这个 做梦的时候想过
Dialogue: 2,0:04:46.52,0:04:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“嗯”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.73,0:04:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.34,0:04:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“感觉你没有说谎哦”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:51.01,0:04:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:04:52.18,0:04:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“鸭儿都硬了”
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.32,0:04:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}痒噻
Dialogue: 2,0:04:55.91,0:04:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}鸭儿从来没有被女人摸过
Dialogue: 2,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“让我摸摸你的鸭儿”
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.06,0:05:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“我来给你口交”
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.87,0:05:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“呵呵”
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}那 那太好了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.90,0:05:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“好可爱”
Dialogue: 2,0:05:16.04,0:05:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}那 请D阿姨的嘴巴和它亲亲
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.97,0:05:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“好吧”
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.24,0:05:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}嘴巴含进去
Dialogue: 2,0:05:25.69,0:05:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:05:26.46,0:05:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“含进去干嘛呢？”
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.86,0:05:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.57,0:05:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“含进去干嘛呢？”
Dialogue: 2,0:05:31.21,0:05:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}吃
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.83,0:05:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:05:34.82,0:05:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}额啊
Dialogue: 2,0:05:36.65,0:05:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.75,0:05:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:05:39.68,0:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好舒服 慢点
Dialogue: 2,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:05:43.97,0:05:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“没得咋子硬哦”
Dialogue: 2,0:05:52.14,0:05:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.12,0:05:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
