Dialogue: 2,0:47:59.51,0:48:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}你在哪儿学的这些技术？
Dialogue: 2,0:48:01.13,0:48:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“啊”
Dialogue: 2,0:48:01.67,0:48:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“没有啦”
Dialogue: 2,0:48:02.62,0:48:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“阿姨当过妓女”
Dialogue: 2,0:48:04.92,0:48:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“这可是我们两个的秘密哦”
Dialogue: 2,0:48:07.32,0:48:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}那当然啦
Dialogue: 2,0:48:10.13,0:48:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“好 起床啦”
Dialogue: 2,0:48:14.95,0:48:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“好臭啊”
