Dialogue: 2,0:48:19.79,0:48:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“又硬了”
Dialogue: 2,0:48:22.67,0:48:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“又想我口交啦”
Dialogue: 2,0:48:26.85,0:48:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}每次看到你它都要硬
Dialogue: 2,0:48:27.84,0:48:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:48:30.31,0:48:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}
Dialogue: 2,0:48:32.35,0:48:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}“那就开始口交啦”
